  :body "# In-Browser Copilot, Page Mutation & Computer Use Specification

> **Subsystem**: `asl/web` • `harness` • `voice` • `vdom`  
> **Target View**: [PlaygroundView.asl](file:///Users/purplelephant/projects/asex/asl/web/src/views/PlaygroundView.asl) & Global Web Showcase  
> **Engine Substrate**: [InBrowserAddie.asl](file:///Users/purplelephant/projects/asex/asl/web/asl-src/components/InBrowserAddie.asl) (WebGPU SLM) + [browser_cdp.asl](file:///Users/purplelephant/projects/asex/harness/src/browser_cdp.asl)  
> **Status**: Technical Specification & Architecture Blueprint (Phase 429 Candidate)

---

## 1. Executive Concept & Vision

The **In-Browser Addie Copilot** transforms the static Playground into an autonomous, interactive AI lab. Embedded as a sleek, collapsible floating window in the browser, Addie acts concurrently as:
1. **An Empathetic Evaluator & Critic**: Watches what the user generates (SVG, Website, Canvas Game), analyzes visual quality and game physics, and offers proactive, actionable feedback.
2. **An In-Place Page Mutation Coding Agent**: Directly patches the active in-memory VFS buffer and DOM (e.g. *\"Draw a green dinosaur in the bottom right corner\"*, *\"Make buttons cyberpunk neon\"*, *\"Add a high-score table\"*).
3. **A Computer Use Navigator**: Interprets intent to navigate the application, inspect code, switch modes, and interact with page elements (e.g. *\"Take me to the homepage\"*, *\"Find the latest article\"*, *\"Open the VFS editor\"*).
4. **A Contextual Action Presets Hub**: Provides dynamically changing action chips tailored to the active artifact.

```
