## 2. UI/UX Architecture: Floating Collapsible Window

### 2.1. Minimized State (Floating Action Badge - FAB)
- Located in the bottom-right corner of the browser viewport (`fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-40`).
- Glassmorphic rounded pill with obsidian dark background (`bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-line`).
- Visual Attention Indicator:
  - Cyan pulsing beacon (`bg-signal animate-pulse`).
  - Active suggestion counter badge: `2 suggestions`.
  - Hover tooltip: `Addie Copilot (Click to expand)`.

### 2.2. Expanded HUD State (Floating Copilot Window)
- Geometry: `w-96 max-h-[580px] rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-line bg-surface/95 backdrop-blur-2xl flex flex-col overflow-hidden`.
- **Header**:
  - Mascot avatar + Title: `Addie Copilot`.
  - Active model indicator: `:mini (1.5B WebGPU)` / `:micro (0.5B)` / `:fast-heuristic`.
  - Window controls: Minimize (`_`), Fullscreen expand, and Clear history.
- **Context Pill Bar**:
  - Live inspection banner: `Inspecting: [2D Micro Drift Racer] • 60 FPS • Canvas 640x360`.
- **Dialogue & Action Stepper**:
  - Scrollable chat message stream showing user prompts, Addie's evaluation scorecards, and step-by-step action execution timelines.
- **Contextual Presets Bar (Smart Chips)**:
  - Horizontally scrollable chips that update dynamically based on the current mode and rendered artifact.
- **Free-Form Input Box**:
  - Multi-line textarea or single-line input with enter-to-send and quick microphone button (linked to the [Voice Pipeline](file:///Users/purplelephant/projects/asex/voice/src/audio_capture.asl)).

